{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body><p>更新時間：12:53 2026-11-27 HKT<br/>發佈時間：12:53 2026-11-27 HKT</p>\n<p>發佈時間：12:53 2026-11-27 HKT</p><img alt=\"徐雨石\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/ur/sthl_square/a1cd82632a639462c89185fc78d8d403/2026-11/a2_0_10.jpg\"/><p>剛周三谷戰，徐雨石以「領䄂勁力」勝出，手風轉順，練者當然希望本周日可以延續贏馬旺勢。今早徐雨石在烽火台底層睇馬，當報爭第九場的「黃金蟬聯」(L479)出操時，徐雨石十分緊張，細心觀看馬匹的操練，重視之情洋溢於色。</p><img alt=\"「黃金蟬聯」\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/1933c6dd5f5b8e88f740a50c49ca2974/2026-11/a21.jpg\" title=\"「黃金蟬聯」\"/><p>「黃金蟬聯」</p><p>陳嘉甜</p><p>最Hit</p>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-27T05:03:54.209737+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":200,"images":2,"source":"星島頭條","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-27T04:53:32+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-27T06:17:28.291815+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-27T04:57:26.308611+00:00","content_hash":"0bcda305e5a49c3af538349bedeb668047b24d1fc5f8d1b68739094130f38ca3","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}